# Project Instructions (Antigravity)

This project follows strict engineering standards for Angular and TypeScript development.

## Core Mandates

### Angular Development
Consult the Angular developer skill instructions in `.agents/skills/angular-developer/SKILL.md`.

## Workspace Conventions
- Use Tailwind CSS for styling.
- Prefer standalone components.
- Use signals for state management.
- Pure presentation skeletons: all content/copy must be externalized to data files.
